WEBVTT

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:05.310
Our next news story...

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:09.980
The president of the world-famous Mikadono Group,

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:13.610
Mikadono Kumagorou-san, passed away today.

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:15.320
He was forty-nine years old.

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:19.830
He was a once-in-a-lifetime president for the company,

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:23.330
and was highly respected for his charisma internationally.

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:28.210
Mikadono-san fell sick half a year ago.

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:30.960
However, various related issues
caused his death sooner than expected.

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.730
The arrangements for a funeral look like a lot of trouble.

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:54.240
I thought "I have to help Mum", but I didn't expect you to go first.

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:59.240
Dad, it seems that you had me in your will to be your successor, but...

00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:02.620
Onii-sama...

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:05.580
Onii-sama...

00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:07.250
Onii-sama!

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:08.540
Who are you?

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:10.280
Where are you?

00:01:10.280 --> 00:01:12.920
Onii-sama, over here!

00:01:13.330 --> 00:01:14.460
I'm sorry.

00:01:14.460 --> 00:01:15.910
I wanted to meet you,

00:01:15.910 --> 00:01:17.930
but there were so many people I couldn't get to you.

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:20.880
Who are you?

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:23.810
I'm Onii-sama's little sister.

00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:26.520
Little sister?

00:01:26.520 --> 00:01:27.810
I'm an only child.

00:01:28.270 --> 00:01:30.820
Onii-sama won't be alone any more.

00:01:30.820 --> 00:01:33.820
You'll be with me from now on.

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:35.450
Together?

00:01:35.450 --> 00:01:36.700
What do you mean?

00:01:37.910 --> 00:01:41.330
I came to marry Onii-sama!

00:01:41.330 --> 00:01:43.080
Marry?

00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:46.080
If you're my little sister, we can't get married.

00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:47.160
Eh?

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:55.510
Shougo-sama.

00:01:56.550 --> 00:01:57.510
Seri-san.

00:01:57.510 --> 00:01:59.010
Did something happen?

00:01:59.010 --> 00:02:01.970
No, nothing.

00:02:06.140 --> 00:02:07.270
She's not there.

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:48.490
Shougo-sama.

00:03:49.050 --> 00:03:50.260
Seri-san.

00:03:51.850 --> 00:03:53.000
Mother as well!

00:03:55.960 --> 00:04:00.760
Thank you very much for taking the one year crash course to succeed the Mikadono Group.

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:02.630
There's no need to thank me...

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:07.810
You did pretty well in our group's academy for the special education of gifted children.

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:10.310
But I had a hard time with the last curriculum,

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:12.640
and I wasn't in time for the second years' opening ceremony.

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:23.650
Shougo, do you remember that Kumagorou has one more condition before you can succeed the Group?

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:25.140
Yes!

00:04:25.140 --> 00:04:29.950
I have to find a woman I love by the time I
graduate high school and become life partners.

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:33.620
Kumagorou thought that if a young man such as yourself gets married and has a home...

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:39.630
...he could gain the composure and dignity necessary to lead the group.

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:43.970
From today on, you will be attending the Miryuuin Academy.

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:45.670
It was the school Kumagorou was once taught in.

00:04:45.670 --> 00:04:47.510
It has the only rightful way of learning.

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:51.770
I am certain you will be able to find the right woman.

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:54.520
Also, this...

00:04:56.270 --> 00:04:57.020
What is this?

00:04:57.480 --> 00:05:00.270
We rented an apartment near the school.

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:03.490
From today on, that will be your new home!

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:06.030
Eh, but I was sure the school had dorms...

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:07.910
What are you saying?

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:10.440
If you are trying to look for a woman to become life partners with,

00:05:10.440 --> 00:05:12.400
aren't the noise rules in those dormitories an inconvenience,

00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:16.040
when you're trying to deepen your relationship?

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:17.200
Eh?

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:19.380
Relationship?

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:19.920
Wai-

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:24.340
All of your things are being sent there.

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:31.220
Should we send a car to take you from there to the academy?

00:05:31.220 --> 00:05:32.850
No, it's okay!

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:38.900
It's the first step of my new life, so I'll walk there by myself.

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:44.570
I said that, but I immediately got lost.

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:49.240
I think it's this way, but...

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:01.630
A bakery?

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:04.130
Shougo.

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:10.140
This year I'll buy a cake and celebrate your birthday with everybody else.

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:11.480
That's right...

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:13.670
Today is my birthday.

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:16.680
It seems like Mum forgot, as she was so busy.

00:06:29.110 --> 00:06:29.660
Look out!

00:06:39.790 --> 00:06:40.460
Are you okay?

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:45.460
Yes.

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:47.090
What's wrong?

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:47.880
Did you get hurt somewhere?

00:06:48.550 --> 00:06:51.890
No, I'm okay.

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:02.270
What an unusual cell phone.

00:07:02.270 --> 00:07:03.520
I've never seen this model before.

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:07.030
There you go.

00:07:07.030 --> 00:07:09.490
Thank you very much.

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:11.530
Is the cake all right?

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:14.740
Yes, but it's a cream puff.

00:07:15.490 --> 00:07:16.540
That uniform...

00:07:17.190 --> 00:07:19.540
You're a Miryuuin Academy student, right?

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:21.540
Yes, that's right.

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:26.340
I was just transferred today, but I got lost on the way there...

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:29.550
Would you mind showing me the way to the academy?

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:30.970
Transfer student?

00:07:31.840 --> 00:07:32.720
Yeah.

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:34.220
My name is Mikadono Shougo.

00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:36.100
As I thought...

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:36.800
Eh?

00:07:36.800 --> 00:07:37.850
As you thought?

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:42.530
I heard there was a second year student transferring here today, so...

00:07:42.530 --> 00:07:43.350
Um...

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:47.110
My name is Tsuruma Konoe.

00:07:47.450 --> 00:07:49.940
Tsuruma... Konoe...

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:52.320
Um, is something wrong?

00:07:52.740 --> 00:07:54.200
No, it's nothing.

00:07:54.540 --> 00:07:56.080
Really. It's nothing!

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:03.110
By the way,

00:08:03.110 --> 00:08:05.330
why are you buying a cream puff in the middle of a school day?

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:09.710
The cream inside the ones from Marie Chocolate is really delicious!

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:15.220
So, because of that?

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:19.720
So... I want to eat them everyday!

00:08:22.390 --> 00:08:27.230
As a part of my routine, I eat one of their cream puffs in that park everyday.

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:36.610
Here.

00:08:36.610 --> 00:08:37.990
This is for you.

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:38.580
Eh?

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:39.410
Mine?

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:42.080
If you don't share this cream puff with me,

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:45.000
I won't show you the way to school.

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:46.000
All right.

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:47.540
Here goes...

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:50.500
It's surprisingly delicious.

00:08:51.010 --> 00:08:52.130
See?

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:01.430
Is it that?

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:09.150
At the hour and half past, that pigeon sings.

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:10.050
Eh?

00:09:10.050 --> 00:09:10.940
I see.

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:17.030
What is it?

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:18.750
Don't move.

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:19.870
Please stay still.

00:09:26.170 --> 00:09:28.790
Okay, it's done now.

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:30.400
T-Thank you!

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:35.170
I don't know why I felt like doing that.

00:09:36.180 --> 00:09:40.160
It's strange, somehow.

00:09:40.160 --> 00:09:43.180
It's like we've known each other for a long time.

00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:50.440
Do you know what they call this?

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:51.440
Eh?

00:09:53.110 --> 00:09:54.940
A destined meeting.

00:10:10.530 --> 00:10:13.380
So, you're the transfer student, Mikadono?

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:14.800
Um...

00:10:14.800 --> 00:10:17.630
You're the homeroom teacher, Kotori-sensei, right?

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:18.560
Yes!

00:10:18.560 --> 00:10:20.530
Is there something strange about that?

00:10:20.530 --> 00:10:21.890
No, not really.

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:24.640
I'll be studying with you from today on.

00:10:24.950 --> 00:10:26.650
My name is Mikadono Shougo.

00:10:26.650 --> 00:10:28.640
Pleased to meet you all!

00:10:32.650 --> 00:10:34.160
Hey, Mikadono.

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:35.820
Don't you have anything else to say?

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:37.530
That was too short.

00:10:38.110 --> 00:10:39.740
Um...

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:46.500
I'm an only child, so I would like to make lots of friends at this school.

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:47.450
All right.

00:10:47.450 --> 00:10:50.100
Now, for your seat.

00:10:50.100 --> 00:10:51.500
I guess next to Tsuruma will do.

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:54.270
Mikadono, Tsuruma is the class representative,

00:10:54.270 --> 00:10:56.510
so if there's anything you don't know, have her tell you.

00:10:56.840 --> 00:10:59.130
We're sitting next to each other again.

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:00.540
We really are.

00:11:00.540 --> 00:11:02.590
Pleased to meet you, Tsuruma-san.

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:07.570
That's Kannagi-san.

00:11:07.570 --> 00:11:08.770
Kannagi Miyabi-san.

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:12.060
Pleased to meet you, Kannagi-san.

00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:17.400
Hey, look!

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:18.690
This is Mikadono-kun.

00:11:18.690 --> 00:11:20.820
He's from Mikadono Group, right?

00:11:20.820 --> 00:11:22.570
He's kind of cool, isn't he?

00:11:23.120 --> 00:11:25.490
You seem to be attracting a lot of attention!

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:31.540
Is Kannagi-san not a very talkative person?

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:32.520
Eh?

00:11:32.520 --> 00:11:34.710
Are you worrying about Kannagi-san?

00:11:34.710 --> 00:11:35.880
Not really.

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:39.170
Well, I greeted her, but she didn't answer.

00:11:39.170 --> 00:11:42.260
It feels like I hurt her feelings, or something.

00:11:42.260 --> 00:11:45.470
I don't think so.

00:11:45.470 --> 00:11:50.810
It doesn't seem like Kannagi-san is the proactive type, nor does she come into contact with people often.

00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:53.230
That should do it.

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:55.110
Thank you very much.

00:11:55.110 --> 00:11:57.230
It's not even your turn to do the cleaning!

00:11:57.230 --> 00:12:00.570
When it's your turn, I'll come and help you.

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:02.700
It's okay! Don't worry about it.

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:05.530
Tsuruma-san, it takes up a lot of time to be in the class committee, right?

00:12:05.530 --> 00:12:07.450
Don't give yourself more trouble.

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:09.620
Is it... troublesome?

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:12.870
Mikadono-san, is it troublesome for me to be with you?

00:12:12.870 --> 00:12:13.580
Eh?

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:15.210
I see.

00:12:15.210 --> 00:12:17.290
You don't want to be with me.

00:12:17.290 --> 00:12:18.680
Er, no!

00:12:18.680 --> 00:12:20.300
I didn't mean it like that.

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:22.470
That's not it, um-

00:12:22.470 --> 00:12:24.260
Geez, I'm only kidding!

00:12:24.260 --> 00:12:27.720
I just felt like teasing you a little bit.

00:12:27.720 --> 00:12:29.850
Oh, you were joking.

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:32.810
You must joke like that fairly often, huh, Tsuruma-san?

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:35.420
So, this morning when you said it was a destined meeting,

00:12:35.420 --> 00:12:36.560
that was a joke.

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:39.070
That's... Um...

00:12:39.070 --> 00:12:40.940
Ah, that's right.

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:45.070
If it's okay with you, can you call me by my given name?

00:12:45.070 --> 00:12:47.950
I can... But why?

00:12:47.950 --> 00:12:52.700
When you say Mikadono, it reminds you of Mikadono Group, right?

00:12:52.700 --> 00:12:54.580
I've disliked it since I was young.

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:57.790
I see. In that case, Mikado-

00:12:57.790 --> 00:13:01.800
I meant, Shougo-san, please call me Konoe as well.

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:02.510
Eh?

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:04.090
If you don't, it's not fair.

00:13:04.590 --> 00:13:07.590
All right then... Konoe.

00:13:07.590 --> 00:13:10.470
Wait, are you getting embarrassed, Shougo-san?

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:13.100
I-I'm not really embarrassed...

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:13.850
No way!

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:16.480
Your face has gone bright red.

00:13:18.150 --> 00:13:19.190
That's a big scar...

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:24.820
I got this when I was a kid.

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:27.610
I had an accident, and somehow I hit my head hard.

00:13:27.960 --> 00:13:31.740
Because of that, my memory of that time is really fuzzy.

00:13:31.740 --> 00:13:34.000
There are some things I can't remember.

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:35.690
I see.

00:13:35.690 --> 00:13:36.500
Your memory has...

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:37.870
I'm sorry.

00:13:37.870 --> 00:13:39.880
I showed you something weird...

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:41.380
It's disgusting, right?

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:42.760
No!

00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:44.260
It's not disgusting at all.

00:13:44.630 --> 00:13:47.510
How could I think of this as being disgusting?

00:13:53.430 --> 00:13:56.230
Let the pain fly away!

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:58.530
It's healed now.

00:13:59.210 --> 00:13:59.900
Thanks.

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:02.650
But, aren't we getting a bit too close?

00:14:02.650 --> 00:14:06.150
Can't we get closer and closer together?

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:11.740
Wai-

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:13.540
Ouch!

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:17.330
Are you all right, Shougo-san?

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:20.460
Yeah, but why did an empty can-

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:28.580
What a show that was.

00:14:28.580 --> 00:14:30.300
What on earth are you doing while on school grounds?

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:33.430
What? Um, this is...

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:36.180
Underneath Shougo-san's hair, there was...

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:38.440
Underneath his hair?

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:42.440
Konoe-chan!

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:44.540
Konoe-chan!

00:14:44.540 --> 00:14:47.240
It's almost time for the class committee meeting!

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:49.160
President Tendou.

00:14:49.160 --> 00:14:51.240
Vice-President Kunitachi-san as well!

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:55.410
If you don't come quickly, I'm going to eat all the tea cakes!

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:57.750
What on earth are you saying, President Tendou?

00:14:57.750 --> 00:14:58.470
Eh?

00:14:58.470 --> 00:15:01.000
But if I don't warn her...

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:02.630
There's no need for a warning like that!

00:15:02.630 --> 00:15:08.670
Um, so does that mean I can eat all the snacks?

00:15:08.670 --> 00:15:10.220
How did it turn into that?

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:13.050
Rinka-chan's angry!

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:16.100
I have a committee meeting, so...

00:15:16.100 --> 00:15:17.890
Right, I got it!

00:15:17.890 --> 00:15:19.230
See you later, Kannagi-san.

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:22.980
There are lots of snacks!

00:15:22.980 --> 00:15:24.730
Really?

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:26.570
Hey, Shougo!

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:27.230
Eh?

00:15:28.740 --> 00:15:30.490
Why do you look so surprised?

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:32.240
You want people to call you by your first name, right?

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:33.740
Y-You were listening?

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:35.330
Not really.

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:38.450
When I was having a nap in the tree, I couldn't help but overhear you.

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:40.830
I can't believe a transfer student could trap a girl so fast,

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:42.620
and such an amazing one, too.

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:44.500
I didn't trap anyone.

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:47.130
It's just that, after we came to throw away the rubbish, we got talking.

00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:52.010
To me, it looked like you were about to kiss her.

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:56.220
That was only because Konoe saw my scar...

00:15:56.220 --> 00:15:57.310
Scar?

00:15:57.310 --> 00:15:58.520
Look, here!

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:04.020
Oh! So that's what happened.

00:16:04.020 --> 00:16:07.400
So you and Tsuruma-san are only classmates?

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:08.150
Of course.

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:09.940
In that case, prove it!

00:16:09.940 --> 00:16:11.360
Prove it?

00:16:12.030 --> 00:16:12.860
Kiss me!

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:13.490
What?!

00:16:14.030 --> 00:16:16.320
If you can kiss a classmate,

00:16:16.320 --> 00:16:18.410
wouldn't it be weird if you can't do the same to me?

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:21.410
Like I said, what happened earlier wasn't a kiss.

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:22.910
Never mind. Just give me a kiss.

00:16:22.910 --> 00:16:24.040
I can't do that.

00:16:24.040 --> 00:16:25.170
Then give me a smooch.

00:16:25.170 --> 00:16:25.920
I refuse!

00:16:25.920 --> 00:16:27.170
How about a snog?

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:28.920
Aren't you just changing the words?

00:16:29.210 --> 00:16:31.380
It can't be helped.

00:16:31.380 --> 00:16:34.180
Then, I'll let you off with just putting your tongue in.

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:35.930
Tongue? You...

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:39.320
Hey, I don't know what you're trying,

00:16:39.320 --> 00:16:41.560
but there's no way I can do something like that.

00:16:41.560 --> 00:16:44.640
After all, we only met each other today.

00:16:45.850 --> 00:16:46.650
Fine! I get it.

00:16:46.980 --> 00:16:49.150
I've had enough.

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:56.660
Onii-chan, welcome home!

00:16:58.740 --> 00:17:00.450
I've been waiting for you all along.

00:17:00.450 --> 00:17:01.790
Onii-chan.

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:16.470
A lot of stuff happened today.

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:20.430
Cool food service!

00:17:23.350 --> 00:17:24.730
Same as above?

00:17:24.730 --> 00:17:27.020
I don't remember ordering something like that.

00:17:30.610 --> 00:17:31.270
All right.

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:37.110
Wait, this is my birthday cake?

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:40.030
Marie chocolate... This morning...

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:42.040
Could it have been Konoe?

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:45.160
But I didn't tell her that it was my birthday...

00:17:45.160 --> 00:17:47.040
And the address on here...

00:17:48.420 --> 00:17:50.340
What's this?

00:17:52.090 --> 00:17:53.420
This is...?!

00:17:55.260 --> 00:17:58.390
Restructuring Warrior, Grand Belion!

00:17:58.390 --> 00:18:00.050
Are you okay, Perin-chan?

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:05.230
Let's go, Ganizeus!

00:18:10.610 --> 00:18:13.400
Restructuring Warrior, Grand Belion!

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:16.610
I loved this when I was small.

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:18.610
Eh? What's this?

00:18:20.820 --> 00:18:23.580
Is this me when I was young?

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:25.450
The girl in there with me is...

00:18:30.960 --> 00:18:31.840
Who's that?

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:33.880
Hello?

00:18:35.090 --> 00:18:36.840
Hello, who are you?

00:18:37.210 --> 00:18:38.880
Onii-sama!

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:42.510
Happy birthday!

00:18:42.510 --> 00:18:45.020
What do you mean, "Onii-sama"?

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:48.060
Who on earth are you?

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:51.150
I'm your little sister.

00:18:51.610 --> 00:18:52.900
Little sister?

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:55.530
Did you get the present?

00:18:56.070 --> 00:18:58.530
So... you sent the present?

00:18:58.530 --> 00:18:59.740
Yes!

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:01.410
And the photo as well...

00:19:01.410 --> 00:19:06.330
It's a photo taken when we went to the
amusement park together when we were young!

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:10.420
It shows me giving you a kiss on the cheek.

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:13.710
It does look like me, but...

00:19:13.710 --> 00:19:16.420
You might have forgotten about it for a while.

00:19:16.420 --> 00:19:18.670
I'm happy that we were able to meet again.

00:19:18.670 --> 00:19:22.220
Wait, how can I have a little sister...?

00:19:28.020 --> 00:19:30.390
Are you really my little sister?

00:19:30.390 --> 00:19:31.660
Tell me!

00:19:31.660 --> 00:19:32.900
Who on earth are you?

00:19:33.360 --> 00:19:37.480
Right now, we go to the same school.

00:19:38.030 --> 00:19:42.450
I was really surprised to see that you had grown up to be so manly!

00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:45.870
And what's more, you helped to throw away the rubbish so gracefully.

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:48.040
Did you see me then?

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:49.540
Your name!

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:50.620
Tell me your name!

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:54.130
I miss you, Onii-sama!

00:20:00.130 --> 00:20:03.010
Shougo-san helped me throw away the rubbish.

00:20:03.010 --> 00:20:04.760
He's such a nice person.

00:20:04.760 --> 00:20:07.140
But he might have a slightly dirty side as well.

00:20:07.640 --> 00:20:11.560
When I wiped off the cream he got on his mouth this morning,

00:20:12.310 --> 00:20:14.560
he looked at my breasts.

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:18.610
So soft, and with plenty of cream...

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:20.320
They're almost like cream puffs.

00:20:20.900 --> 00:20:25.370
Shougo-san, feel free to eat my cream puffs.

00:20:27.830 --> 00:20:29.330
No, no!

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:31.580
Shougo-san, you can't do that!

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:33.830
Shougo-san, that's dirty!

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:36.840
You made me say that by looking at me with such dirty eyes!

00:20:42.340 --> 00:20:45.340
I have a sister...

00:20:46.850 --> 00:20:48.850
If we're really blood-related...

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:51.850
or if we were born of different mothers...

00:20:52.560 --> 00:20:54.350
Shougo-san.

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:55.150
Good morning.

00:20:57.940 --> 00:21:00.070
What's the matter, Shougo-san?

00:21:00.070 --> 00:21:00.830
It's nothing.

00:21:00.830 --> 00:21:03.360
I've got this feeling that I'm being watched.

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:10.240
Based on last night's phone call, my sister is in this school!

00:21:10.240 --> 00:21:13.040
What's more, she was also close to me.

00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:14.370
At the funeral service...

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:17.380
I came to marry you, Onii-sama.

00:21:17.880 --> 00:21:20.840
So, if I met and decided to be life partners with a girl,

00:21:20.840 --> 00:21:22.880
and if she was actually my sister,

00:21:22.880 --> 00:21:23.880
then my sister and I would get...

00:21:24.550 --> 00:21:25.220
...married!

00:21:39.230 --> 00:21:39.810
Hey!

00:21:39.810 --> 00:21:40.870
Wait!

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:51.030
There's nowhere else to run.

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:53.830
Sneaking around and spying on me... what are you planning to do?

00:21:56.250 --> 00:21:58.420
Isn't that obvious?

00:21:59.460 --> 00:22:02.000
I'm worried about you, Onii-chan!

00:22:02.750 --> 00:22:04.340
Onii-chan?

00:22:04.340 --> 00:22:06.010
Then that means... you're my...

00:23:42.160 --> 00:23:46.310
Shougo, for what reason were you transferred to Miryuuin Academy?

00:23:46.310 --> 00:23:47.500
Answer me!

00:23:47.500 --> 00:23:48.900
Mum, that's...

00:23:48.900 --> 00:23:53.490
Shougo, when you answer my question, salute me and say "Sir!"

00:23:53.490 --> 00:23:55.280
Sir! Yes, Sir!

00:23:55.280 --> 00:23:58.970
To find a woman to become life partners with!

00:23:58.970 --> 00:24:03.350
Next time, episode 2: Dance with a little sister in the moonlight!

00:24:03.350 --> 00:24:04.750
Little sister?

00:24:04.750 --> 00:24:08.050
I haven't heard anything about that.
